    {
      "target": "Strings/schedules/Evelyn",
      "key": "winter_17.000",
      "field": null,
      "source": "This is one of the newer traditions in Pelican Town... but we've taken to it rather quickly. Haven't we, George?",
      "translation": "Tohle je jedna z novějších tradic v Pelikánově... ale rychle jsme si ji oblíbili. Viď, Georgi?",
      "sourceSHA256": "4a3add44a3645051787cec130037d47bb5dec0f18d98a499f2ffe4e7ab3f5dfc",
      "translationSHA256": "58c837257ac336ffe9d72ff08a199072384382c2cb856fca384de88ef8e66758",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/schedules/Evelyn",
      "key": "23.000",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Now now, dear... It's important that Doctor Harvey takes a good look at you. He's a nice young man! Behave yourself, for your dear old wife's sake.",
      "translation": "Ale no tak, drahý... Je důležité, aby tě doktor Harvey pořádně prohlédl. Je to milý mladý muž! Chovej se slušně, kvůli své drahé stařičké manželce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "bab4f6621cbb09d9599c1c30513f00577282fe67046007028d0dbf173f264b83",
      "translationSHA256": "80e89a08447f39c02c549796fcaefa29f343866382bde36271bd8fed815469da",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/schedules/Evelyn",
      "key": "23.001",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Could you check his lungs? He's been wheezing lately.",
      "translation": "Mohl byste mu zkontrolovat plíce? V poslední době sípe.",
      "sourceSHA256": "3d1f24704af3234c228c5ebc221175356c65c17e799ca419ccb88e6d4c44182c",
      "translationSHA256": "d8a61c0637e3ec8b3ef46e489ead13accb386abb5a9120c97488875ecda81bc0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Strings/schedules/Evelyn",
      "key": "2.000",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When you get to be my age you have to see the doctor more often.",
      "translation": "V mém věku už musí člověk chodit k lékaři častěji.",
      "sourceSHA256": "67a5d233c932af8eea5bb38bd0c8932689a6d1da7713cd69bf6e670d80834854",
      "translationSHA256": "059a77da280034f2c5d843b2ac2424ca20b403cff09730bfa3933b0bd7e4afef",
